      'Invented Reverse SMT (rSMT): a hardware threading technique for multi-core processors that earned IBM Patent US8595468B2 and IBM\'s Hero Patent award',
      'Filed second patent: Method to Identify and Generate Critical Timing Path Test Vectors — automated hardware test vector generation for PowerPC chip verification',
